       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-CMEF-ZORSE-BRIDGE.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-FUSION-BRIDGE-PROOFS.
           05  WS-ZORSE-BESSEL-DECOMP-OK   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-SCSI-CHANNEL18-GATING-OK PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-REBAR-CONSERVATION-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-MOTZKIN-GALOIS-SCALE-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTIENT0-DETENT-RESTORE  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-BRIDGE-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-BRIDGE-PROVEN        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-BRIDGE-CODE        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-BESSEL-AND-SCSI.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-REBAR-AND-GALOIS.
           PERFORM 3000-EVALUATE-TOTIENT-DETENT.
           PERFORM 4000-SYNTHESIZE-BRIDGE-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-BESSEL-AND-SCSI.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-ZORSE-BESSEL-DECOMP-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-SCSI-CHANNEL18-GATING-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-REBAR-AND-GALOIS.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-REBAR-CONSERVATION-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-MOTZKIN-GALOIS-SCALE-OK.
       3000-EVALUATE-TOTIENT-DETENT.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTIENT0-DETENT-RESTORE.
       4000-SYNTHESIZE-BRIDGE-PROOFS.
           IF WS-ZORSE-BESSEL-DECOMP-OK = 1 AND
              WS-SCSI-CHANNEL18-GATING-OK = 1 AND
              WS-REBAR-CONSERVATION-OK = 1 AND
              WS-MOTZKIN-GALOIS-SCALE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-TOTIENT0-DETENT-RESTORE = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-BRIDGE-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-BRIDGE-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-BRIDGE-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-BRIDGE-CODE.
